# Check Doc Opportunities (Workspace)

**Workspace-specific**: Doc opportunity detection additions (no base rule)

## Canonical Doc Location

`docs/architecture/` is the single source of AI-readable architecture documentation.
Use `docs/architecture/README_AI.md` as the routing index to identify which file covers
the changed area. Module-level `README_AI.md` files are supplemental deep-dives for
modules not consolidated into `docs/architecture/` (e.g., `systems/proxy/core/*/README_AI.md`).

## Additional Detection Patterns

| Type | grep Pattern | Required Update |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| Event emit | `publish.*\(['"][A-Z_]+['"]` | EVENT_EMISSION_POINTS + frontmatter |
| Event subscribe | `subscribe\(['"][A-Z_]+['"]` | EVENT_CONSUMPTION_POINTS + frontmatter |
